# Coding Style

Do not mutate existing objects. Return a new copy.

Validate at system boundaries. Fail fast. Never swallow errors. User-facing messages stay friendly; logs keep detail.

Functions under 50 lines. Files under 800 lines. Nesting under 4 levels. Named constants instead of magic numbers.
